msgid "发布范围"
msgstr "Release Scope"

msgid ""
"上一版本基线：``5.1.0`` 的版本提交 `09930b87355b8abbb75e39b693a6a7765ece2397 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/commit/09930b87355b8abbb75e39b693a6a7765ece2397>`__。"
