"Previous baseline: the ``5.1.0`` version commit `09930b87355b8abbb75e39b693a6a7765ece2397 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/commit/09930b87355b8abbb75e39b693a6a7765ece2397>`__."

msgid ""
"本次版本：``5.1.1``，终点为 `v5.1.1 <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/tree/v5.1.1>`__ "
"指向的本次版本提交；完整提交身份以该标签为准。"
msgstr ""
"Current version: ``5.1.1``, ending at this version commit pointed to by `v5.1.1 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/tree/v5.1.1>`__; the tag determines its full commit "
"identity."

msgid ""
"更新区间为 ``(上一版本提交, 本次版本提交]``，起点不含、终点包含。仅总结 ReliefNT 内核、驱动、UAPI 和本仓开发输入的有效变化；合并去重，不包括 ReliefOS "
"应用、桌面配置、安装器或镜像打包。"
msgstr ""
"The update interval is ``(上一版本提交, 本次版本提交]``, excluding the start and including the end. Summarize "
"only effective ReliefNT kernel, driver, UAPI, and repository development-input changes, merging "
"and deduplicating; exclude ReliefOS applications, desktop configuration, installer, and image "
"packaging."

msgid "本次是正式源码 Release，提供标签、中文说明及 GitHub 自动源码归档，不附内核二进制或系统镜像。"
msgstr ""
"This is a stable source Release with a tag, Chinese notes, and GitHub automatic source archives, "
"without kernel binaries or system images."

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid "DRM、vmwgfx 与图形资源"
msgstr "DRM, vmwgfx, and Graphics Resources"

msgid ""
"为 VMware SVGA-II 增加 Linux 兼容 DRM 设备层：按设备和能力公开 "
"``/dev/dri/card0``、``/dev/dri/renderD128``，实现文件/主设备认证、受拥有者约束的缓冲区与表面、传统 KMS、framebuffer 及 fence "
"等接口，并补充 PCI/DRM sysfs 信息。"
msgstr ""
"Added a Linux-compatible DRM device layer for VMware SVGA-II, exposing ``/dev/dri/card0`` and "
"``/dev/dri/renderD128`` according to device and capabilities. Implemented file/master "
"authentication, owner-constrained buffers and surfaces, legacy KMS, framebuffers, fences, and "
"PCI/DRM sysfs information."

msgid ""
"增加适配上游 Mesa 的有界 VGPU9 vmwgfx 路线：能力协商、资源与上下文、验证后的 execbuf 命令提交、着色器、查询和同步；支持同一设备内的 PRIME "
"表面引用交换。该接口不承诺跨设备 DMA-BUF 导入、挂接或通用 Linux DRM 全量兼容。"
msgstr ""
"Added a bounded VGPU9 vmwgfx path for upstream Mesa: capability negotiation, resources and "
"contexts, validated execbuf submission, shaders, queries, and synchronization. Supports same-"
"device PRIME surface reference exchange. This does not promise cross-device DMA-BUF "
"import/attachment or complete general Linux DRM compatibility."

msgid ""
"加强 GMR、guest-backed 对象/MOB "
"和提交中资源的生命周期管理；关闭句柄、异常退出或解除映射时按使用状态延迟回收。无可运行任务时，在独立调度服务栈上推进有界资源退休，避免在活动陷阱返回栈上执行终结器。"
msgstr ""
"Strengthened lifecycle management for GMR, guest-backed objects/MOBs, and submitted resources, "
"deferring reclamation according to use when handles close, tasks exit abnormally, or mappings "
"disappear. With no runnable tasks, bounded resource retirement advances on a separate scheduler "
"service stack, avoiding finalizers on an active trap-return stack."

msgid ""
"改进 fbdev 模式验证、framebuffer 与 DRM 映射衔接；补充 ``FB_ACTIVATE_*`` 常量，以及 "
"``asm/ioctl.h``、``drm.h``、``drm_mode.h``、``vmwgfx_drm.h`` 的公开导出。设备节点默认权限为 ``0660``、组 GID 44。"
msgstr ""
"Improved fbdev mode validation and framebuffer/DRM mapping integration. Added ``FB_ACTIVATE_*`` "
"constants and public exports of ``asm/ioctl.h``, ``drm.h``, ``drm_mode.h``, and ``vmwgfx_drm.h``. "
"Device nodes default to mode ``0660`` and group GID 44."

msgid "同步、缓存与调度"
msgstr "Synchronization, Caching, and Scheduling"

msgid ""
"将非 lazy vmwgfx fence 重试合并为有界、可中断的轮询批次，保持 fence 身份、超时 "
"cookie、截止时间和信号/重启语义；减少批次元数据分配，避免将大量小重试转换为不必要的调度开销。"
msgstr ""
"Coalesced non-lazy vmwgfx fence retries into bounded interruptible polling batches, preserving "
"fence identity, timeout cookies, deadlines, and signal/restart semantics. Reduced batch metadata "
"allocation to avoid turning many small retries into unnecessary scheduling overhead."

msgid ""
"对经过验证的 VMware BAR/FIFO 路径准备并核对 write-back 映射，补充 PCI 资源/页缓存属性处理；保留必要的 flush 通知、查询同步和资源引用，合并待提交的 KMS"
" damage 区域。"
msgstr ""
"Prepared and checked write-back mappings for validated VMware BAR/FIFO paths and added PCI "
"resource/page-cache attribute handling. Retained required flush notifications, query "
"synchronization, and resource references, and merged pending KMS damage regions."

msgid "成功安装捕获信号的用户栈帧后唤醒可中断任务，避免被信号打断的无超时 futex 等待使 Xorg 长期停驻。DRM 同步阶段结合可中断性处理信号，避免在仍被设备使用时提前释放对象。"
msgstr ""
"Wake interruptible tasks after successfully installing a caught-signal user stack frame, "
"preventing signal-interrupted futex waits without timeouts from stalling Xorg indefinitely. DRM "
"synchronization handles signals with interruptibility in mind, avoiding freeing objects while "
"still used by the device."

msgid "描述符、映射与异常隔离"
msgstr "Descriptors, Mappings, and Exception Isolation"

msgid "补充 DRM 所需的描述符、close-on-exec、文件共享、内存映射与保护/解除映射语义，维护 fork 及 VMA 变化期间的对象引用、边界和写权限。"
msgstr ""
"Completed descriptor, close-on-exec, file-sharing, memory-mapping, protection, and unmapping "
"semantics needed by DRM, preserving object references, bounds, and write permissions during fork "
"and VMA changes."

msgid "增加按目标任务页表进行受检查的用户内存复制，避免依赖当前 CR3 读取其他任务地址；非法范围或缺页失败返回明确错误。"
msgstr ""
"Added checked user-memory copying through the target task's page tables instead of relying on "
"current CR3 to read another task's addresses. Invalid ranges or failed page faults return explicit"
" errors."

msgid ""
"用户态一般保护异常（#GP）转为强制 ``SIGSEGV`` 并走正常用户调度路径，使用完整陷阱帧；内核态 #GP 继续保留致命异常策略，不把过期 CR2 当作用户 #GP 的故障地址。"
msgstr ""
"Userspace general protection faults (#GP) become forced ``SIGSEGV`` and take the normal user "
"scheduling path with a complete trap frame. Kernel #GP retains its fatal-exception policy; stale "
"CR2 is not treated as a user #GP fault address."

msgid "文本 VT 历史恢复先在同布局 RAM 表面完成重放，再提交到可见 framebuffer，降低恢复过程中逐次重绘的显示开销。"
msgstr ""
"Text VT history restoration replays into a same-layout RAM surface before committing to the "
"visible framebuffer, reducing repeated redraw overhead during restoration."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking Changes"

msgid "**否（相对于 5.1.0 已发布源码中的既有公开 UAPI）。** 本区间没有删除既有公开头或缩减已有线协议结构；主要新增 DRM/vmwgfx 接口与内部正确性、性能修复。"
msgstr ""
"**No (relative to existing public UAPI in the released 5.1.0 source).** No existing public headers"
" were removed or wire structures reduced in this interval; changes mainly add DRM/vmwgfx "
"interfaces and internal correctness/performance fixes."

msgid "新 DRM 节点有明确权限和能力条件，应用不能假定 render 节点总存在、任意 DRM ioctl 都受支持或任意 GPU 都可用。"
msgstr ""
"New DRM nodes have explicit permission and capability requirements. Applications must not assume a"
" render node always exists, every DRM ioctl is supported, or any GPU is usable."

msgid "同设备 PRIME 不等于通用跨设备共享；不支持的请求应处理明确错误并选择适合的软件路线。"
msgstr ""
"Same-device PRIME is not general cross-device sharing. Handle explicit errors for unsupported "
"requests and choose appropriate software paths."

msgid ""
"这不是全量 ABI 认证：现有 ``reliefos_driver_kernel_api`` 的 golden 仍与实际结构不一致，见下文。该问题在 5.1.0 已记录，本次没有通过修改 "
"golden 掩盖它。"
msgstr ""
"This is not complete ABI certification: the existing ``reliefos_driver_kernel_api`` golden still "
"disagrees with the actual structure, as noted below. This was recorded in 5.1.0 and has not been "
"concealed by changing golden data."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Update and Migration Notes"

msgid "获取本标签源码并重新构建内核，保持实际启动的 ``kernel.sys``、导出的 UAPI 和配套用户态版本一致；本源码 Release 不提供可直接替换的预编译文件。"
msgstr ""
"Obtain this tag's source and rebuild the kernel, keeping the booted ``kernel.sys``, exported UAPI,"
" and accompanying userspace versions aligned. This source Release has no ready-to-replace "
"precompiled files."

msgid "需要 VMware 3D 路线时核对虚拟显卡与宿主能力；缺少相应能力时应保留二维 framebuffer 或软件渲染回退，不强行公开不可用的 render 节点。"
msgstr ""
"For VMware 3D, verify virtual graphics and host capabilities. Without the necessary capabilities, "
"retain 2D framebuffer or software-rendering fallback rather than exposing an unusable render node."

msgid "使用 ``/dev/dri/`` 的账户需得到 GID 44 的组授权。现有账户库、自定义设备策略和不同 GID 映射应人工合并；账户创建与桌面配置由 ReliefOS 主仓负责。"
msgstr ""
"Accounts using ``/dev/dri/`` need GID 44 group authorization. Manually merge existing account "
"databases, custom device policies, and different GID mappings. Account creation and desktop "
"configuration belong to the ReliefOS main repository."

msgid "更新导出白名单和 SDK 后重新编译图形用户态；按已实现的有界接口使用缓冲区、表面、fence 和同设备 PRIME，保留错误、超时和中断处理。"
msgstr ""
"Recompile graphics userspace after updating export allowlists and the SDK. Use buffers, surfaces, "
"fences, and same-device PRIME within the implemented bounded interfaces, retaining error, timeout,"
" and interruption handling."

msgid "现有安装原地替换内核、全部应用组合及真实硬件迁移未完成整版验证。先在独立副本检查启动、VT 往返、设备权限、资源回收和软件回退。"
msgstr ""
"In-place kernel replacement, all application combinations, and physical hardware migration have "
"not passed full-release validation. First use a separate copy to check boot, VT round trips, "
"device permissions, resource reclamation, and software fallback."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer Notes"

msgid "生产入口为本仓根 GNU Make，内核与驱动编译由本仓负责，不消费父仓私有实现。"
msgstr ""
"The production entry is GNU Make at this repository's root. This repository compiles the kernel "
"and drivers without consuming private implementations from the parent."

msgid "基础版本为 ``5.1.1``，数字字段为 ``5/1/1``；``EXTRAVERSION`` 与 ``LOCALVERSION`` 继续独立追加，完整版本保留现有字符集和长度检查。"
msgstr ""
"The base version is ``5.1.1`` with numeric fields ``5/1/1``. ``EXTRAVERSION`` and ``LOCALVERSION``"
" remain separately appended, and full versions retain existing character-set and length checks."

msgid "UAPI 通过 ``headers_install`` 白名单导出。新 DRM 头用于目标用户态编译；内核私有指针、资源实现和页表结构不作为公共线协议传递。"
msgstr ""
"UAPI is exported through the ``headers_install`` allowlist. New DRM headers compile target "
"userspace; private kernel pointers, resource implementations, and page-table structures are not "
"public wire formats."

msgid ""
"图形兼容范围受 SVGA-II、VGPU9 和实际能力检查限制。不承诺 atomic modesetting、硬件 vblank、硬件光标、跨设备 DMA-BUF、所有 Mesa 功能或物理宿主 "
"GPU 利用率测量。"
msgstr ""
"Graphics compatibility is limited by SVGA-II, VGPU9, and actual capability checks. No promise is "
"made for atomic modesetting, hardware vblank/cursors, cross-device DMA-BUF, every Mesa feature, or"
" physical host GPU utilization measurements."

msgid "本区间实现对应的 DRM/SVGA、调度与信号宿主夹具及平台验收记录保存在配套 ReliefOS 主仓；这些测试的新增属于主仓，不能算成本仓新增了同一批工具。"
msgstr ""
"DRM/SVGA, scheduling/signal host fixtures, and platform acceptance records for this interval "
"reside in the accompanying ReliefOS main repository. Those added tests belong to the main "
"repository and must not be counted as the same tools newly added here."

msgid ""
"后续版本遵循 `发布规范 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/blob/v5.1.1/docs/RELEASE_PROCESS.md>`__，从本次版本提交之后计算更新范围，两仓独立编写说明。"
msgstr ""
"Future versions follow the `release rules "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/blob/v5.1.1/docs/RELEASE_PROCESS.md>`__, computing "
"changes after this version commit and writing the two repositories' notes independently."

msgid "验证与已知限制"
msgstr "Validation and Known Limitations"

msgid "**源码检查：** 审阅本仓 5.1.0 版本提交后的有效差异，对合并历史去重；核对版本输入、README 当前示例和发布范围。未修改 ABI golden。"
msgstr ""
"**Source checks:** Reviewed effective changes after the 5.1.0 version commit, deduplicating merge "
"history; checked version inputs, current README examples, and release scope. ABI golden data was "
"not modified."

msgid ""
"**本次编译与宿主工具通过：** 从父仓根执行 ``TMPDIR=\"$PWD/out/tmp\" make -C kernel/reliefnt O=\"$PWD/out/xorg-"
"vmware-debug/reliefnt\" PROFILE=debug -j4 kernel test-tools test-header-export``。普通及 ASan/UBSan "
"共享工具检查通过；头文件导出覆盖 85 个头，包含白名单精确性、独立 C/C++ 编译、私有头隔离及移除后无残留。"
msgstr ""
"**Compilation and host tools passed:** From the parent root, ran ``TMPDIR=\"$PWD/out/tmp\" make -C"
" kernel/reliefnt O=\"$PWD/out/xorg-vmware-debug/reliefnt\" PROFILE=debug -j4 kernel test-tools "
"test-header-export``. Normal and ASan/UBSan shared-tool checks passed. Header exports covered 85 "
"headers, including exact allowlisting, independent C/C++ compilation, private-header isolation, "
"and no residue after removal."

msgid ""
"**父仓构建适配通过：** ReliefOS 的 ``build-info kernel test-tools`` 成功，主仓与内核版本字符串为 ``5.1.1``，内核数字字段为 "
"``5/1/1``；父仓版本、后缀、无操作生成、适配和 procfs 定向检查通过。"
msgstr ""
"**Parent build adaptation passed:** ReliefOS ``build-info kernel test-tools`` succeeded; main and "
"kernel version strings were ``5.1.1``, and kernel numeric fields ``5/1/1``. Parent version, "
"suffix, no-op generation, adaptation, and targeted procfs checks passed."

msgid ""
"**ABI 门禁未通过：** 本次 ``test-abi`` 再次报告 ``reliefos_driver_kernel_api`` golden 大小 168、实际大小 296，以及 "
"PCI/DMA/IRQ/音频/日志回调的偏移差异。完整测试门禁因此不能记为通过，需维护者另行审阅 ABI 决策。"
msgstr ""
"**ABI gate failed:** ``test-abi`` again reported ``reliefos_driver_kernel_api`` golden size 168 "
"versus actual 296, with PCI/DMA/IRQ/audio/logging callback offset differences. The complete test "
"gate therefore cannot be marked passed; maintainers must review the ABI decision separately."

msgid "**打包：** 本仓不生成 ReliefOS 系统镜像；本次不发布内核二进制，未将旧内核文件重标为 5.1.1。"
msgstr ""
"**Packaging:** This repository does not generate ReliefOS system images. No kernel binaries are "
"published, and old kernel files were not relabeled as 5.1.1."

msgid "**QEMU：** 区间内配套主仓记录了有限的设备/桌面及软件回退测试；本次没有对最终 5.1.1 标签进行完整启动、图形和异常恢复验收。宿主夹具和编译不替代目标虚拟机运行证明。"
msgstr ""
"**QEMU:** The accompanying main repository recorded limited device/desktop and software-fallback "
"tests within the interval. No complete boot, graphics, and exception-recovery acceptance was "
"performed on the final 5.1.1 tag. Host fixtures and compilation do not replace target-VM runtime "
"evidence."

msgid ""
"**VMware：VMware 验证未完成。** 配套主仓的 SVGA3D 文档记录了冻结源码下的原生 VMware GPU/PRIME/KMS、桌面、软件回退及局部性能测量；这些不等同于最终 "
"5.1.1 整版验收，也不表示所有负载都比软件渲染快。"
msgstr ""
"**VMware: validation is incomplete.** The accompanying main repository's SVGA3D document records "
"native VMware GPU/PRIME/KMS, desktop, software fallback, and partial performance measurements on "
"frozen source. These do not constitute full final-5.1.1 acceptance or show every workload is "
"faster than software rendering."

msgid "**真实硬件：** 本版未验证。不声称完成 Linux/POSIX 认证或任意物理 GPU 验证。"
msgstr ""
"**Physical hardware:** Not validated in this release. No claim of Linux/POSIX certification or "
"arbitrary physical GPU validation is made."

msgid "获取与追溯"
msgstr "Obtaining Source and Traceability"

msgid ""
"获取 `v5.1.1 源码 <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/tree/v5.1.1>`__ 及 GitHub 自动生成的 Source "
"code ZIP/TAR.GZ；下载缓存和预编译产物不包含在本次发布中。"
msgstr ""
"Obtain `v5.1.1 source <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/tree/v5.1.1>`__ and GitHub's "
"automatic Source code ZIP/TAR.GZ. Download caches and precompiled artifacts are not included."

msgid ""
"`完整提交与差异 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/compare/09930b87355b8abbb75e39b693a6a7765ece2397...v5.1.1>`__。compare"
" 展示完整历史，本说明不将纯合并或版本条目列作功能。"
msgstr ""
"`Full commits and diff "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefNT/compare/09930b87355b8abbb75e39b693a6a7765ece2397...v5.1.1>`__."
" compare shows the full history; these notes do not treat pure merges or version entries as "
"features."

msgid ""
"配套主仓的桌面/账户集成、测试夹具和限定场景证据见 `ReliefOS 5.1.1 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/releases/tag/v5.1.1>`__ 与该标签下的 `SVGA3D 文档 "
"<https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.1/docs/SVGA3D.md>`__。"
msgstr ""
"For accompanying desktop/account integration, test fixtures, and limited-scenario evidence, see "
"`ReliefOS 5.1.1 <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/releases/tag/v5.1.1>`__ and its "
"`SVGA3D documentation <https://github.com/ReliefOSProject/ReliefOS/blob/v5.1.1/docs/SVGA3D.md>`__."
